Let
$f\left( x \right) = \left\{ {\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}
 {\cos \left( {\frac{\pi }{4}\left( {1 - x + \left[ x \right]} \right)} \right),}&{{\text{if}}}&{\left[ x \right]\,\,{\text{is}}\,\,{\text{even}}} \\ 
 {\sin \left( {\frac{\pi }{4}\left( {x - \left[ x \right]} \right)} \right),}&{{\text{if}}}&{\left[ x \right]\,\,{\text{is}}\,\,{\text{odd}}} 
\end{array}} \right.$ 
where $[x]$ denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to $x.$ In the interval $(0,5),$ if $m$ is the number of points of discontinuity of $f$ and $n$ is the number of points where $f$ is not differentiable, then $m+n$ equals _______.
